  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Open a scene in a window: timeline, view picker, frame (#4)\n* Open a .apak directly, and start on a scene picker without a scene (#5)\n* Release downloads: a portable zip and a Linux tarball with every demo scene (#6)\n* Windows installer: NSIS setup with shortcuts, .apak association and uninstaller (#7)\n* --frame and --compare: a camera path's frame, and an A | B compare from the command line (#8)\n* README: layer diagram without overlapping labels (#9)\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/jose-villegas/loupe/commits/v0.1.0\n",
